                                                "sense_id": "b4861c7f-9740-3d5b-8723-7364ff58900c",
                                                "text": "Subject: Fire... Dear Sir-stroke-Madam: Fire. Exclamation mark. Fire. Exclamation mark. Help me. Exclamation mark. 123 Carendon Road. Looking forward to hearing from you. All the best, Maurice Moss."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a001c571-cf00-4722-a02c-0b79b9bf312e",
                                                "sense_id": "b4861c7f-9740-3d5b-8723-7364ff58900c",
                                                "text": "Traditionally, the exclamation mark has been used sparingly, especially in formal writing."
                                            }
